    routePath: 'badacey',
    LLM: 'Game: Badacey. Type: Triple Draw Split-Pot Poker. Rules: Half pot for best 4-card Badugi; Half pot for best 5-card Ace-to-Five low. 3 draws. Blinds applied. Discard 0-5.',
    Player: "Welcome to the Badacey table. You've been dealt 5 cards. Remember, you want as many different suits as possible for a Badugi, and the lowest ranks for the Lowball half. It's time for the first drawâ€”how many cards are you swapping?",
    tagline: 'Two ways to win. Half the pot. Zero high cards. Master the Triple Draw.',
    gameCategory: 'Poker',
