          deckDescription: 'One standard 52-card poker deck with four suits (clubs, diamonds, hearts, spades) and thirteen ranks in each suit. No jokers are used; the full deck is available to build both Badugi and Ace-to-Five lowball hands in Badacey.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (clubs, diamonds, hearts, spades). Suits matter for the Badugi half of Badacey, where a qualifying Badugi must contain four distinct suits; duplicate suits reduce the effective Badugi hand size.',
          rankDescription: 'Standard thirteen ranks from ace through king in each suit. For the lowball half aces play low and straights and flushes are ignored; for Badugi, lower unique ranks in four different suits form the strongest qualifying hands.',
